# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"QPU time estimation with and without OBP {#qpu-time-estimation-with-and-"
"without-obp}"
msgstr ""
"Estimate ng QPU time na may at walang OBP {#qpu-time-estimation-with-and-"
"without-obp}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users generally want to know how much QPU time is required for their experiment.\n"
"However, this is considered a hard problem for classical computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Karaniwang nais ng mga users na malaman kung gaano karaming QPU time ang kailangan para sa kanilang eksperimento.\n"
"Gayunpaman, ito ay itinuturing na mahirap na problema para sa classical computers.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"QESEM offers two modes of time estimation to inform users about the feasibility of their experiments:\n"
"1. Analytical time estimation - gives a very rough estimation and requires no QPU time. This can be used to test if a transpilation pass would potentially reduce the QPU time.\n"
"2. Empirical time estimation (demonstrated here) - gives a pretty good estimation and uses a few minutes of QPU time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nag-aalok ang QESEM ng dalawang modes ng time estimation upang ipaalam sa mga users ang feasibility ng kanilang mga eksperimento:\n"
"1. Analytical time estimation - nagbibigay ng napakagaspang na estimate at hindi nangangailangan ng QPU time. Maaari itong gamitin upang masubukan kung ang isang transpilation pass ay posibleng magbawas ng QPU time.\n"
"2. Empirical time estimation (ipinakita dito) - nagbibigay ng napakahusay na estimate at gumagamit ng ilang minuto ng QPU time.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In both cases, QESEM outputs the time estimation for reaching the required "
"precision for **all** observables.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa parehong kaso, ang QESEM ay naglalabas ng time estimation para sa pag-"
"abot ng kinakailangang precision para sa **lahat** ng observables.\n"

